IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0017.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PAY0017C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> UNION DUES DEDUCTED
    05 WS-DUES            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-UNION-DUES
    DISPLAY "WS-DUES=" WS-DUES
    STOP RUN.
3000-UNION-DUES.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF WS-GRSP >= 3200
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF UNI-MEMBER
        *> HIGHER UNION DUES
        IF WS-GRSP >= 4000
            MOVE 55 TO WS-DUES
        ELSE
            MOVE 25 TO WS-DUES
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-DUES
    END-IF.
